1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:00,490
Senior, are you alright ?

25
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:05,050
I found the way to beat the Great Dragon Formation.

26
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:07,610
Don't you know the Death Spell ?

27
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:12,730
Come on, let this old man witness the power of your Death Spell !

28
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,610
I won't fight you anymore.

29
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,730
Outrageous !

30
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,690
It's not up to you to decide whether you fight !

31
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:28,490
Senior, since we are retreating,

32
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:31,610
could it be that the Great Dragon Formation's flaw is distance ?

33
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,570
Correct.

34
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:35,410
Xie Donglai did not attack us immediately

35
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,610
but repeatedly tried to lure me closer to the formation to fight.

36
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,730
It means the farther he is from the formation

37
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,250
the lower its effect is.

38
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,810
Sword of Ji Realm Divine Sense

39
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:16,050
The lower his cultivation is,

40
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:18,090
the easier it is for me to destroy the formation's core.

41
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:21,730
No... If I don't use the Dragon Sword to block this thing

42
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:23,130
my soul will be damaged.

43
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,290
But if I keep blocking like this...

44
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,970
I... I can't...

45
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,330
I must return to the formation.

46
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,490
Now or never !

47
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,050
No !

48
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,370
This is impossible...

49
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,410
This is impossible !

50
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:02,650
The... The formation has been broken !

51
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,810
It broke !

52
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:23,010
Everyone thinks a formation's core must be inside it.

53
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:25,210
Only someone as intelligent as Master

54
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:28,210
could've found the true location of the formation's core.

55
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,850
The Dragon Sword is destroyed...

56
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:36,450
You have destroyed the core of the Great Dragon Formation.

57
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,490
This old man admits defeat.

58
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:43,370
This is the Sect Leader Token of the Fighting Evil Sect.

59
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:45,090
From now on,

60
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,930
we are at your command.

61
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:57,130
Senior !

62
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,130
Master !

63
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,610
He... he is a sword cultivator ?

64
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:12,930
I never thought that after giving it my all,

65
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:15,970
I would still be no match for you.

66
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:18,970
Sect Leader ! The Sect Leader has fallen.

67
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,250
Sect Leader ! This...

68
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:23,490
We welcome the new Sect Leader !

69
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,930
Welcome Sect Leader !

70
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:28,890
Welcome Sect Leader !

71
00:05:29,520 --> 00:05:31,570
Welcome Sect Leader !

72
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:33,890
Master,

73
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:37,490
shouldn't we hold a ceremony for the Sect Leader succession ?

74
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:41,130
That way the whole Sea of Devils will know of your power !

75
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:47,090
You will act as Sect Leader for now.

76
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:51,250
Prepare a secluded cave,

77
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:52,850
I need to cultivate.

78
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,610
The Elders said

79
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:59,450
that this is where

80
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,450
that villain Xie Donglai used to cultivate.

81
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:03,250
Don't worry Master,

82
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,770
this place is very safe.

83
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:10,450
I will send you home after I'm done cultivating.

84
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:14,010
Will you really send me back ?

85
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:18,970
For now... I need to heal my injuries.

86
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,090
Let's go.

87
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,370
Where ?

88
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,610
We have some people to kill.

89
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:05,730
Others would go to see a romantic scenery

90
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:07,770
like a sunrise or a sunset.

91
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:11,490
But he took me... to kill people...

92
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,690
The past 4 years,

93
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:17,770
he saved me countless times.

94
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:20,450
This is how I will pay him back.

95
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:06,930
Tie Zhu, I heard that Immortals can also marry.

96
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,450
If you have time to come home,

97
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:10,970
we can meet some girls in the village.

98
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:13,690
If there's a good one, we'll arrange a marriage.

99
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,370
Dear...

100
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:17,050
What are you worrying about ?

101
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,730
Our Tie Zhu is an Immortal !

102
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:22,130
How could he have a mortal wife ?

103
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,290
Fine, I'll listen to your father.

104
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,930
I'll wait and see

105
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:29,090
what kind of person you'll bring back.

106
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:33,250
Father, Mother, don't worry.

107
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:36,090
Tie Zhu will definitely bring back a good wife.

108
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,370
But not now...

109
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:40,130
Even if I have

110
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:42,330
established my power in the Sea of Devils.

111
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,130
I still have enemies.

112
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:48,290
She will be safer if she is not by my side.

113
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:56,370
Mistress, please have a rest.

114
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:58,290
Don't call me Mistress.

115
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:01,970
Okay, I won't call you Mistress.

116
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:04,930
You've been working on the formation

117
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:08,050
tirelessly since Master went into secluded cultivation.

118
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,890
Don't overuse your life energy like that.

119
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,450
I'm almost done...

120
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,930
Prepare a secluded cave for me.

121
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:26,930
Understood.

122
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:39,690
How much cultivation did you recover ?

123
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:44,850
I only recovered to Late stage Foundation Establishment.

124
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:47,970
If it weren't for your Sword Spirit always competing with me,

125
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,850
I would've recovered to Core Formation.

126
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:54,530
Actually I'm Peak Late stage...

127
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:57,370
Just a step away from Core Formation.

128
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:19,050
When did I reach Core Formation ?

129
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:22,290
I must have devoured too much...

130
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:24,530
I didn't even notice it happening...

131
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:27,090
Have you recovered your memory ?

132
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:30,330
When I entered Core Formation,

133
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:32,810
I started seeing weird images in my head.

134
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,730
How does he know ?

135
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:36,970
I'll fight him !

136
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:39,450
No...

137
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:41,250
I don't think I can win...

138
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:47,410
I've decided, I'll fight him !

139
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:56,610
Master, spare me...

140
00:10:58,520 --> 00:10:59,610
Master, spare me !

141
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,770
How many souls did you devour ?

142
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,210
Spit them all out.

143
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:20,690
He's kidding me...

144
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:23,450
I worked so hard to snatch all these souls...

145
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:26,370
I'll have my revenge one day !

146
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:30,850
Wait until I recover to Nascent Soul.

147
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:57,090
3 days later

148
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:09,130
Senior, why are you out so soon ?

149
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:13,650
What did you do the past 3 days ?

150
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:15,010
You look exhausted.

151
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,770
Drink this.

152
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:20,490
Now that I refined the pill,

153
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:22,810
I'm useless to you, right ?

154
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:25,170
Thank you Senior.

155
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:27,770
I'm fine, let's go.

156
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:42,050
I will return in 10 days for the Sect Leader succession ceremony.

157
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:57,570
The sea is reforming.

158
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:59,850
I've never seen the fog turn into a sea.

159
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:02,450
That's because every time it happened,

160
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:03,570
you were cultivating.

161
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:06,650
The sea transformed 4 times in 4 years.

162
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:09,010
Each time, I got extremely nervous.

163
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:11,490
I had to pay close attention to the formation.

164
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:13,090
I would only relax

165
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,530
when it was over.

166
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:17,570
When the sea transformed,

167
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:19,570
all I could see through the formation

168
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:21,810
was the deep blue sea water outside.

169
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:26,890
Occasionally, some Spirit Beasts would swim by.

170
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,450
Was it beautiful ?

171
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,410
Very beautiful.

172
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:47,410
Back then, the Heaven Defying Bead accidentally devoured the Fire Spirit Beast King.

173
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:49,770
I unintentionally became the target of the Fire Spirit Beasts.

174
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:51,090
My bad luck

175
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,370
destroyed the whole Burning Fire country.

176
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,730
How much of what happened next

177
00:13:55,800 --> 00:13:57,650
was under my control ?

178
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:59,810
How much of it was my fate ?

179
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:02,090
I can't quite tell anymore.

180
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,810
We're almost there.

181
00:14:15,280 --> 00:14:16,570
I'll see you off here.

182
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:20,250
Thank you for these past 4 years.

183
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:27,690
I left a sliver of my Divine Sense in your Soul Blood.

184
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:29,530
No one below Nascent Soul

185
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:31,330
will be able to harm you.

186
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:38,410
Senior, why don't you hide with me in the Luo River Sect for a while ?

187
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:39,850
No need.

188
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:44,290
Will we have a chance to meet again in the future ?

189
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:52,210
These are pills I have made in the past few years.

190
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:55,050
The jade has an explanation of all of them.

191
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:04,930
4 years ago, I promised to bring you back safely.

192
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:07,010
Now that we're here,

193
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,370
we no longer

194
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:09,770
owe each other anything.

195
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:12,570
Farewell.

196
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:17,370
Senior...

197
00:15:19,040 --> 00:15:20,330
This is for you.

198
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:32,690
Senior,

199
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:34,490
I want to thank you

200
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:37,130
for saving my life countless times these past 4 years.

201
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:40,090
The time I spent in the Sea of Devils

202
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,850
is something I’ll never forget…

203
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:44,570
Since our separation is inevitable,

204
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:46,010
I made this gift for you.

205
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:49,290
This jade is the epitome of my formation skills.

206
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:51,890
It's a derived version of the Great Dragon Formation

207
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:53,010
with improvements.

208
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:56,690
This formation is a fusion of attack and defense.

209
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,050
But compared to attack,

210
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:00,330
defense is the true purpose of this formation.

211
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:04,410
Wan'er knows that Senior has his own goals.

212
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:07,010
The cultivation path is extremely dangerous

213
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,850
but I hope that if you encounter danger in the future,

214
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:11,850
this formation can delay it for a moment.

215
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:13,810
If it helps you,

216
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:15,490
Wan'er will be satisfied.

217
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,730
So this is Qian Kun's cultivation.

218
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:48,450
If I consume it when I try to form a Nascent Soul,

219
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:49,850
it will improve my chance of success.

220
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,490
It's time to leave.

221
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,290
Senior Situ,

222
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:59,610
I will reach Soul Transformation one day.

223
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,370
That's when I will be able to wake you up.

224
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:05,690
I, Wang Lin, promise it to you.

225
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,090
We were short on time

226
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:19,570
but we finally managed to repair the formation.

227
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:21,810
The Sect Leader will arrive soon,

228
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:22,850
stand up straight !

229
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:35,610
Welcome back Sect Leader.

230
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:38,250
Welcome back Sect Leader.

231
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:41,010
The execution order is gone ?

232
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:42,690
Our Sect Leader is so powerful

233
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:46,090
that he got rid of the Hundred Days Execution order in just 10 days.

234
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:49,410
Why else would we honor him as Sect Leader ?

235
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:55,690
Please Master, accept the Sect Leader Token.

236
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:08,570
All hail the Sect Leader !

237
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:24,770
Ancestor, the Zhen Family that disrespected you

238
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:26,930
has been completely exterminated.

239
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:36,770
Teng Huayuan...

240
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:40,970
Wait until I, the Sect Leader of Fighting Evil Sect, form my Nascent Soul.

241
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:42,930
That's when I will kill you !

242
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:45,570
Every single person named Teng in the country of Zhao

243
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:47,490
will be buried with you !

244
00:18:59,840 --> 00:19:02,770
Did you hear that dragon roar a few days ago ?

245
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:07,290
It was the succession ceremony of the Fighting Evil Sect.

246
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:10,210
Their new Sect Leader

247
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:12,170
not only single-handedly broke the Great Dragon Formation

248
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:15,690
but he also killed Xie Donglai in one single move.

249
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:17,690
I heard that

250
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:21,890
this person cultivates the extremely vicious Death Spell.

251
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:24,450
The Death Spell ?

252
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:34,170
This old man is pretty interested in the person you mentioned.

253
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:38,570
Fellow cultivator, please lead the way to the Fighting Evil Sect.

254
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:37,450
Duanmu Ji
Eight Extremes Devil Lord
Devil Lord of Qi Mei City
Middle stage Soul Formation

255
00:19:41,370 --> 00:22:04,100
Wang Lin got some loot from all the people he killed that wasn't shown.

He obtained a weird black scroll that he cannot see through with his Divine Sense and that he cannot open. This scroll will be shown later on in the series without explaining where he got it from.

Then he obtained hundreds of golden cores from all the kills:

After carefully putting away the scroll, Wang Lin began to ponder. After a long time, he took out a golden core from his bag of holding. Its color had already darkened. He pondered for a bit before taking out more than 100 golden cores. All of them were dim, emanating a feeling of death.

If it was in the past, Wang Lin would immediately devour them as he got them, but on the way here, Li Muwan told him that although devouring golden cores would increase his cultivation level, it would also cause his spiritual energy to become tainted, as well as cause the spiritual energy in his body to become a mess. Also, golden cores had different properties. If too much of the opposite was absorbed, it would make his spiritual energy go crazy, making him lose control and go mad.

256
00:20:10,370 --> 00:20:17,500
Count the specks of time

257
00:20:14,250 --> 00:20:17,500
floating down gently.

258
00:20:17,610 --> 00:20:23,740
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

259
00:20:24,610 --> 00:20:31,260
Forever lock away the scars

260
00:20:28,410 --> 00:20:31,260
of this mortal life.

261
00:20:31,270 --> 00:20:37,780
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

262
00:20:38,170 --> 00:20:45,500
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

